title: 'pallet-validator-collators: migrate MaxCollators to Option<u32>'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `MaxCollators` is stored as `Option<u32>` with `DefaultMaxCollators` as default. The new
    migration `MigrateV0ToV1` rewrites a cap stored as `u32` as `Some(cap)`. Without a stored
    cap, `MaxCollators` reads `DefaultMaxCollators`. When that default is `Some(_)` and a set of
    validators is stored, the migration draws the collators again under it, as
    `set_max_collators` does.

    Asset Hub Westend and People Westend run the migration.
crates:
- name: pallet-validator-collators
  bump: minor
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: people-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
